  "items": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "关于“避免信息误解”，我发现大家的观点不太一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这很正常。先把共同目标和优先顺序说清楚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我担心协调的时候会让人觉得我在指挥别人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你可以先说明责任和限制，再邀请大家补充。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "如果有人不同意我的方案呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先问他担心什么。不同意见有时能帮助我们改进方案。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我以前一有压力就想快点决定。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "越有压力，越需要把事实和判断分开。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "效率和质量有时候会冲突。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那就明确什么必须做好，什么可以先做到够用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我也想给同事真实的反馈，但怕伤人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "针对事情，不针对人；说具体情况，也说你希望怎么改。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这样是不是更容易建立信任？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。稳定、透明的沟通比偶尔说好听的话更有用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "责任边界怎么判断？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "看角色、承诺和实际能力，超出边界的事情要及时说明。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "如果会议里出现冲突呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先让每个人把理由说完整，再找真正的分歧点。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_019.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我发现很多误会其实来自信息不完整。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_020.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "所以重要决定最好留下一段清楚的记录。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_021.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这和“避免信息误解”也有关系。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_022.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，把问题放回真实情境里，判断会更准确。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_023.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那我先把优先顺序和责任写下来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_024.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "然后跟相关的人确认一次，这一步很关键。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_025.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我希望最后不是只完成任务，也能让合作更顺。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 26,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_026.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这就是成熟的协调：结果和关系都要照顾。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 27,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_027.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "好，我觉得现在有一个比较清楚的方向了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 28,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_line_028.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那就按这个方向试一次，再根据反馈调整。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 29,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_word_001.m4a",
      "type": "vocabulary",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "协调",
      "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
      "order": 30,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_word_002.m4a",
      "type": "vocabulary",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "观点",
      "emotion": "neutral"
    },
