      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "关于“避免信息误解”，我发现大家的观点不太一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 40,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_002.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "如果有人不同意我的方案呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 41,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_003.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "效率和质量有时候会冲突。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 42,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_004.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这样是不是更容易建立信任？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 43,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_005.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "看角色、承诺和实际能力，超出边界的事情要及时说明。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 44,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_006.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "所以重要决定最好留下一段清楚的记录。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 45,
      "file": "hsk4_sc015_sentence_007.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "然后跟相关的人确认一次，这一步很关键。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
